sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cron as pg_cron (19:00 IST)
    participant EF as ef-dpr-builder
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant AI as AI provider
    participant Snd as whatsapp-send EF
    participant Meta as Meta Cloud API
    participant C as Client phone (WhatsApp)
    participant Log as whatsapp_log

    Cron->>EF: dispatch per project
    EF->>PG: SELECT today's site_updates, photos, materials, labour
    PG-->>EF: rows
    EF->>AI: buildDPR(rows, lang)
    Note over AI: LANG_INSTRUCTIONS injects "respond in te/hi/en"
    AI-->>EF: 4-paragraph summary

    EF->>Snd: POST /whatsapp-send {kind:'template', template:'daily_progress_te', components:[{params:[summary, photo_url]}]}
    Snd->>Snd: rate-limit check (per org, 10/min)
    alt under limit
        Snd->>Meta: POST /v18.0/{phone_id}/messages
        Meta-->>Snd: {messages:[{id}]} | error
        Snd->>Log: INSERT whatsapp_log (status, meta_id, raw_response)
        alt sent ok
            Meta->>C: deliver template message
            C-->>Meta: read receipt
            Meta->>Snd: status webhook (delivered → read)
            Snd->>Log: UPDATE status='delivered' / 'read'
        else error
            Snd-->>EF: 4xx/5xx
            EF->>EF: backoff + retry next hour
        end
    else rate-limited
        Snd-->>EF: 429
        EF->>EF: queue for later
    end
